SERVING RECIPE AND RUNTIME FOUNDATION
serve-tp2.sh and recipes/ adapt the upstream DevelopingDad serve-spark.sh
and eugr/spark-vllm-docker cluster recipe. Changes made here include native
two-node rank wiring, NVIDIA CDI device use, the qualified BF16-KV/16-slot
profile, and portable publication settings. The bounded memory/cache setup
and many kernel flags are retained from the upstream launcher.
eugr/spark-vllm-docker: Copyright (c) 2026 Eugene Rakhmatulin, MIT.
Its complete MIT notice is preserved at third_party/licenses/EUGR-MIT.txt.

